{"id":"u-fd72b242-3fa2-4f02-9865-cf97208220dc","src":"community","title":"lean 3 days straight, full body","author":"kevin H.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/4hWbbe-lean-3-days-straight","desc":"**Lean 3 Days Straight** is a workout plan i made because i was 47kg and wanted to lean bulk but i never really went to the gym because of my size and because i had scoliosis and never thought the gym would work, i finally got enough courage to push passed everyone saying stuff and it fueled me even more to grow and get bigger so i made this plan and made a lot of progress while keeping abs sharp and visible, i was only able to workout 3 days a week and it was 3 days in a row which gave me 4 rest days to fully recover and then i could go again, harder, it helped me become a lot bigger and grow, and gave me all the results i wanted, bigger legs, bigger arms, sharp abs all the way through and built up my back a lot, i went from nothing to so much with this plan i made and i already know it would help so many people out there in my case even if your trying to lose weight this is an amazing plan to use for 3 days straight.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-02T23:33:21.193Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Back,Bicep,tricep,Forearm,abs","legs, glutes, core","push + arm pump"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bayesian Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Spider Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12